ind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、氏族、未名者或未定指代；不補姓名、成員或官職持有人。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples","book_id":"b-shiji-067","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-067-disciples"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p032","text":"宰予晝寢。子曰：「朽木不可雕也，糞土之墻不可圬也。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m032-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"宰予","kind":"person","person_id":"4uh_n5r_0id","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m032-0005","start":5,"end":6,"surface":"子","kind":"person","person_id":"0xl_7ir_tmn","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples","book_id":"b-shiji-067","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-067-disciples"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p033","text":"宰我問五帝之德，子曰：「予非其人也。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m033-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"宰我","kind":"person","person_id":"4uh_n5r_0id","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m033-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"五帝","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、氏族、未名者或未定指代；不補姓名、成員或官職持有人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m033-0008","start":8,"end":9,"surface":"子","kind":"person","person_id":"0xl_7ir_tmn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m033-0012","start":12,"end":13,"surface":"予","kind":"person","person_id":"4uh_n5r_0id","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples","book_id":"b-shiji-067","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-067-disciples"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p034","text":"宰我爲臨菑大夫，與田常作亂，以夷其族，孔子恥之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m034-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"宰我","kind":"person","person_id":"4uh_n5r_0id","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m034-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"田常","kind":"person","person_id":"rv1_o3i_m12","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m034-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"其族","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、氏族、未名者或未定指代；不補姓名、成員或官職持有人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m034-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"0xl_7ir_tmn","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples","book_id":"b-shiji-067","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-067-disciples"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p064","text":"南遊至江，從弟子三百人，設取予去就，名施乎諸侯。孔子聞之，曰：「吾以言取人，失之宰予；以貌取人，失之子羽。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m064-0006","start":6,"end":11,"surface":"弟子三百人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者或未定指代，未補姓名、成員或親屬；譬喻與未遂取室不作已確證家屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m064-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"諸侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者或未定指代，未補姓名、成員或親屬；譬喻與未遂取室不作已確證家屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m064-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"0xl_7ir_tmn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m064-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"宰予","kind":"person","person_id":"4uh_n5r_0id","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m064-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"子羽","kind":"person","person_id":"oxa_rta_lvd","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples","book_id":"b-shiji-067","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-067-disciples"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-001-wudi","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-001","source_id":"s-shiji-001-wudi","source":{"title":"史記／卷001","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷001","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?t